  "title": {
    "rendered": "سورة الماعون مكتوبة بخط كبير: 7 آية مع الترجمة الإنجليزية"
  },
  "content": {
    "rendered": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">نقدم سورة الماعون مكتوبة بخط كبير، وعدد آياتها 7، مع تلاوة صوتية آية بآية.</p>\n\n\n<div style=\"background-color: #EAEAEA; padding: 15px; text-align: center;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic', Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0;\">بِسْمِ اللَّهِ الرَّحْمَٰنِ الرَّحِيمِ</h2>\n</div>\n\n\n<p><script type=\"text/javascript\">\n  function changesoundy(ID) {\n    var sound_id = document.getElementById(\"quran_player_by_sora\");\n    sound_id.innerHTML = '<div style=\"margin-top:15px;\"><audio controls autoplay><source src=\"'+ID+'\" type=\"audio/mpeg\">متصفحك لا يدعم عنصر الصوت</audio><br /><a href=\"'+ID+'\">تنزيل الملف</a></div>';\n  }\n</script><h2 class=\"sora_title\">سورة الماعون</h2><div id=\"quran_player_by_sora\"></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/107001.mp3');\">أَرَأَيْتَ الَّذِي يُكَذِّبُ بِالدِّينِ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الماعون [1]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/107002.mp3');\">فَذَٰلِكَ الَّذِي يَدُعُّ الْيَتِيمَ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الماعون [2]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/107003.mp3');\">وَلَا يَحُضُّ عَلَىٰ طَعَامِ الْمِسْكِينِ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الماعون [3]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/107004.mp3');\">فَوَيْلٌ لِّلْمُصَلِّينَ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الماعون [4]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/107005.mp3');\">الَّذِينَ هُمْ عَن صَلَاتِهِمْ سَاهُونَ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الماعون [5]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/107006.mp3');\">الَّذِينَ هُمْ يُرَاءُونَ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الماعون [6]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/107007.mp3');\">وَيَمْنَعُونَ الْمَاعُونَ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الماعون [7]</span></div></div></p>\n",
    "protected": false
  },
